    SENDING, SENT, DELIVERED, READ, FAILED
}
```

#### [NEW] `domain/chat/model/Message.kt` & `Conversation.kt`
Bổ sung `val status: MessageStatus` cho Message.

#### [NEW] `data/chat/remote/dto/...`
